{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Heaven's Dale needs you...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are reborn in a peaceful place called Heaven\u2019s Dale. Your role here is to work as a carpenter and earn prestige as a great person!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/3794ce2ac4af931d5ede39b528fc416b.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=994 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/3794ce2ac4af931d5ede39b528fc416b.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/3794ce2ac4af931d5ede39b528fc416b.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A peaceful life...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are plenty of activities to enjoy: gather wood, mine in caves, go fishing, find romance, travel to the moon, complete achievement rooms, unlock recipes, and earn prestige through hundreds of constructions scattered across Heaven\u2019s Dale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">My Heaven\u2019s Dale isn\u2019t your typical farming simulator, but you can still plant crops and take care of a ranch too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Another World</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a trip to the moon, I bet many mysteries are waiting for you there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>You are not alone!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You don\u2019t need to live alone with your cats forever! (Unless you want to!). There are many residents to befriend, and even marriage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cffc942a7372788ec2f6e4bfeff3b2aa.avif?t=1768853242\" width=725 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/f6078a07593423e4747ca20c163452e7.avif?t=1768853242\" width=739 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Learn more about:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and plant seeds beside your house!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your carpentry with a basement and a second floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy chickens, cows, goats, pigs, and ducks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the residents with over 40 different quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the local town and buy an outfit for your cat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find romance among 12 different villagers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection of over 90 fish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your jewel collection by exploring the caves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection of cooking recipes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the moon and build a house there!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy each day with different background music!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a mystery involving the former owner...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E-mail for contact: <a href=\"mailto:myheavensdale@gmail.com\">myheavensdale@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/13736374df2d747303a150a1f73ab8bb.avif?t=1768853242\" width=630 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708250?t=1768853242","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708250?t=1768853242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/1ba51cafd93138e226fa68f8d1a95980e05b6a58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768853242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/1ba51cafd93138e226fa68f8d1a95980e05b6a58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768853242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3709290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Heaven's Dale needs you...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are reborn in a peaceful place called Heaven\u2019s Dale. Your role here is to work as a carpenter and earn prestige as a great person!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/3794ce2ac4af931d5ede39b528fc416b.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=994 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/3794ce2ac4af931d5ede39b528fc416b.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/3794ce2ac4af931d5ede39b528fc416b.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A peaceful life...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are plenty of activities to enjoy: gather wood, mine in caves, go fishing, find romance, travel to the moon, complete achievement rooms, unlock recipes, and earn prestige through hundreds of constructions scattered across Heaven\u2019s Dale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">My Heaven\u2019s Dale isn\u2019t your typical farming simulator, but you can still plant crops and take care of a ranch too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Another World</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a trip to the moon, I bet many mysteries are waiting for you there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.poster.avif?t=1768853242\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.webm?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.mp4?t=1768853242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>You are not alone!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You don\u2019t need to live alone with your cats forever! (Unless you want to!). There are many residents to befriend, and even marriage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cffc942a7372788ec2f6e4bfeff3b2aa.avif?t=1768853242\" width=725 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/f6078a07593423e4747ca20c163452e7.avif?t=1768853242\" width=739 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Learn more about:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and plant seeds beside your house!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your carpentry with a basement and a second floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy chickens, cows, goats, pigs, and ducks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the residents with over 40 different quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the local town and buy an outfit for your cat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find romance among 12 different villagers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection of over 90 fish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your jewel collection by exploring the caves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection of cooking recipes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the moon and build a house there!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy each day with different background music!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a mystery involving the former owner...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E-mail for contact: <a href=\"mailto:myheavensdale@gmail.com\">myheavensdale@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/13736374df2d747303a150a1f73ab8bb.avif?t=1768853242\" width=630 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DreamingCat"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/027d1e55a8644341e00ef8449b19db3cf2017b4a/header.jpg?t=1768853242","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[